        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>会被无缘无故讨厌的原因有哪些？</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  body {\n    background-color: #f2f2f0;\n    background-image:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 3px),\n      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.015) 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 4px);\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 78px 34px 40px 30px;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    font-size: 27px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #0d3b16;\n    margin: 0 0 62px 0;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .body-text {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    line-height: 1.72;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .body-text p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .highlight {\n    color: #14532d;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <h1 class=\"title\">1、会被无缘无故讨厌的原因有哪些?</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p class=\"indent\">“无缘无故的讨厌”有很多原因，比如:</p>\n      <p>①长相凶狠的人让我们害怕(承认吧，我们都是外貌协会);</p>\n      <p>②刻板印象让你对一个人产生先入为主的偏见:印象里重庆人火爆，上海人爱计较。于是你真去到重庆，并且正好遇到重庆人当街斗殴，你的大脑就会激活“重庆人火爆”的认知并加强;</p>\n      <p class=\"highlight\">③心理学上认为的:对一个人的好恶可能是“投射效应”在起作用。</p>\n      <p class=\"indent\">那么，“投射效应”到底是如何会让别人无缘无故讨厌你的呢?</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
